 ## Install
 
+The official GitHub repository `https://github.com/josephtandle/myos-dispatch` is the sole code source.
+
+### Non-destructive existing installs
+
+The installer supports non-destructive existing installs:
+1. Discover an existing canonical checkout from the registered hook path in `~/.claude/settings.json` or standard location (`~/myos-dispatch` on macOS, `%USERPROFILE%\myos-dispatch` on Windows).
+2. Verify origin: confirm `git remote get-url origin` matches `https://github.com/josephtandle/myos-dispatch`.
+3. If clean (`git status --porcelain` is empty), fetch tag `v3.4.1` (`git fetch origin --tags && git checkout v3.4.1`) and rerun the idempotent installer.
+4. Never overwrite dirty or foreign checkouts, user settings, credentials, projects, indexes, or overrides.
+5. If an existing checkout is dirty or foreign, preserve it untouched and use a separate versioned canonical checkout (e.g. `~/myos-dispatch-v3.4.1`).
+
+The installer never replaces or overwrites user files, user settings, credentials, projects, indexes, or overrides.
+
